AWPTCM-T9709 (1.0) — MAC/Phy TLV: port speed=10000 duplex=auto
tb470 IE520 stack · 2026-09-03 · RESULT: port-configurable; OPERATIONAL PROOF DEFERRED (module + link swap)

The SFP+ ports 25 & 26 accept `speed 10000` (empty-port probe, port-level capability):
  - empty port2.0.25 (SFP+): speed 10000  ACCEPTED ; speed 1000 ACCEPTED ; speed 100/10 REJECTED
  - 1G ports (1-24):         speed 10000  REJECTED
So 10000 IS supported on this hardware (25/26), correcting an earlier note. Operational
verification needs a 10G module in 25/26 and a 10G partner. The operational MAU depends on media:
copper AT-SP10T -> 10GigBaseT ; SR fibre -> 10GBASE-SR. DEFERRED — module + link swap later
(Terrence, 2026-09-03). See port-capability-matrix.txt.
